PurposeUX uses MLX-VLM and the Qwen3.5 model family. Base weights are downloaded
separately from mlx-community/Qwen3.5-0.8B-4bit at the revision recorded in
the adapter metadata. Qwen3.5-0.8B is published under Apache-2.0 by Qwen.
The release adapter is a derivative training artifact; it does not include base
weights. Preserve the upstream license and notices when redistributing weights.

The included interface fixtures and synthetic rubric examples were authored for
this project using Codex. They are not screenshots of third-party services or
records of real users. No human preference study is claimed.
